<StandardPageLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How Painting for Beginners will identify compensated product links, free products, sponsorships, and other material relationships.">
  <h2>Current status</h2>
  <p>Painting for Beginners does not currently publish affiliate links, sponsored recommendations, or paid product placements.</p>
  <h2>If that changes</h2>
  <p>A recommendation containing a compensated link will include a plain-language disclosure close to the recommendation so readers do not need to search for it. Sponsored content and products supplied without charge will also identify the relevant relationship.</p>
  <p>Compensation will not guarantee positive coverage. Product information should explain the project need first, avoid unsupported performance claims, and distinguish a tested recommendation from a general example.</p>
  <h2>Reader cost</h2>
  <p>An affiliate commission ordinarily does not add a separate charge to the reader, but price, availability, and merchant terms remain controlled by the seller. We will not publish invented prices, discounts, or merchant relationships.</p>
</StandardPageLayout>
